OL,3,AUS says it will issue visa to Flavio
OL,4,ABolsonaro as Brazilian authorities
OL,5,Aquestion his whereabouts
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Those who have nothing to hide have
OL,8,Fnothing to fear," says newly re-elected
OL,9,FBrazilian President Lula, remarking on
OL,10,Fhis rival's whereabouts.
OL,12,FBolsonaro, who was defeated in the
OL,13,FBrazilian presidential election on
OL,14,FSunday, is under investigation for
OL,15,Falleged corruption and money
OL,16,Flaundering, which he denies
OL,18,FThe right-wing candidate lost the
OL,19,Felection to his left-wing rival,
OL,20,FPresident Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva and
OL,21,Fhas yet to accept the result
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
